      "content": "thanks. that's a good start. i noticed u mentioned the islamic golden age briefly, but most of the list seems really focused on europe. what about other places like asia or africa? were there any major stuff happening in places like china or the mali empire that actually shaped things like science or how they ran their societies? i don't want my project to be just a \"western history\" paper if i can help it.",
